\paragraph{Statement recorded in the supplied source.}
Classify finitary-factor-of-independent-and-identically-distributed complexity; characterize derandomization on graph classes; determine the limits of Borel and continuous Lovász Local Lemmas; construct finitary-factor-of-independent-and-identically-distributed perfect matchings on trees; decide when Borel unfriendly colorings exist; develop a general complexity theory of local graph problems; and transfer techniques among distributed, finitary, and descriptive settings. \href{https://doi.org/10.4171/owr/2022/8}{[S2]}
